# Build context exclusions.
#
# The build context is the whole repository (docker-compose.yml sets
# `context: .`). Everything not excluded here is sent to the Docker daemon on
# every build, whether or not the Dockerfile copies it.
#
# The Dockerfile only needs: pyproject.toml, uv.lock, backend/ and data/.
#
# NOT excluded on purpose: backend/chroma_db/ and backend/docstore/. The
# Dockerfile's `COPY backend/ ./backend/` is what gives a LOCAL build its
# vector index, because the working tree also holds data/.manifest.json and
# ingestion returns early when every file is already listed (ingest.py:91).
# Excluding them would leave a local container with an empty index.
#
# The HuggingFace Space is a different case and does not rely on any of this.
# It builds from a git clone, and .gitignore excludes the index directories
# and (since 2026-08-18) data/.manifest.json too. The Space therefore starts
# with no manifest, ingest.py:32 returns an empty one, and the container
# ingests all 26 files in the background thread at app.py:69.

# Virtual environment. The image builds its own with `uv sync`.
.venv/
**/.venv/

# Frontend. Not copied by the Dockerfile.
frontend/

# Git metadata.
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github/

# Superseded index directories, kept aside during the rebuild. These sit inside
# backend/, so without this they would be copied into the image (638 MB).
**/*.bak
backend/chroma_db.bak
backend/docstore.bak

# LLM response cache. Regenerated on demand; not needed at runtime.
.langchain.db

# Secrets. The Dockerfile never copies these; this is a second barrier.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.local

# Python build and cache artefacts.
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
wheels/

# Node.
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.next/

# Logs and evaluation output.
*.log
*_log.txt
*_logs.txt
.pytest_cache/

# Documentation and media not used at runtime.
assets/
README.md
CLAUDE.md
DECISIONS.md
OPEN.md

# Agent and editor configuration.
.claude/
.agents/
scratch/
miscellaneous/

# Notebooks and ad-hoc scripts.
*.ipynb
add_test.py
debug_splitter.py
test_*.py

# OS noise.
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
